# Rye' initial conversation

# Suggest player needs money
act_speak ["Good evening to you, fellow interloper."]
act_speak ["I can sense that you are in need of some money"]
act_speak ["Perhaps three pounds is all you need?"]
act_speak ["..."]

# Provide them with a quest
act_speak ["I take it you're not the talkative type, rather instead one for the dark and brooding persona"]
act_speak ["I shan't dawdle any longer then"]
act_speak ["I require one 'Choccy bar'"]
act_speak ["In exchange you will receive three whole pounds"]
act_speak ["Now be gone, lest you dampen my mystique"]

# Swap to checking for choccy
set_script ["WaitingOnChoccy"]